# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Booking email (Resend) — set these in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables
# The booking form works without them (it falls back to a pre-filled mailto to
# booking@nov.dj), but set them for a real, professional email flow.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1) API key — https://resend.com/api-keys  (works immediately, even before a domain)
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# 2) Where enquiries are read. Private — never exposed to the client.
#    Defaults to booking@nov.dj if unset.
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=booking@nov.dj

# 3) The "From" address.
#    - Before verifying nov.dj: leave the default (Resend's shared sender).
#    - After verifying nov.dj in Resend: use e.g. "NOV <booking@nov.dj>".
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=NOV Booking <onboarding@resend.dev>
